### Backfill customer into membership cache
POST http://localhost:8081/customer-cache
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "id": "{{customerId}}",
  "name": "New Member",
  "dateOfBirth": "1987-08-12",
  "email": "info@codeartify.com"
}

### List cached customers
GET http://localhost:8081/customer-cache
Accept: application/json

### Find the seeded Maya Example customer
GET http://localhost:8081/customer-cache?query=Maya
Accept: application/json

### Get Maya by deterministic customer ID
GET http://localhost:8081/customer-cache/workshop-customer-01
Accept: application/json
